  "description": "Endymion passed the interview to finally become a Swallow Knight because he’s... cute? His lifelong dream has turned out to be nothing like what he had expected. He thought knights were supposed to be honorable and tough! But there is also good news: his past experience as a party host may come in handy after all. How will his life change as he becomes a Swallow Knight? \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)",
